{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05804","headline":"奉和圣制早度蒲津关 · 徐安贞","name":"奉和圣制早度蒲津关","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙掌临秦甸，虹桥辟晋关。\n两都分地险，一曲度河湾。\n路得津门要，时称古戍闲。\n城花春正发，岸柳曙堪攀。\n後乘犹临水，前旌欲换山。\n长安回望日，宸御六龙还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐安贞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05804.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05804","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}